  "body": "## 0.2.2 Release\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Avoid panic when satellite propagation fails\r\n- Skip orbital elements that SGP4 cannot initialize\r\n- Route events only to the visible tab\r\n\r\n### 🚜 Refactor\r\n\r\n- *(widgets)* Share the centered paragraph helper\r\n- *(satellite_groups)* Drop always-empty return from reload_selected_entries\r\n- *(timeline)* Use Duration::hours and canvas Line constructor\r\n\r\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\r\n\r\n- Enable the test job\r\n\r\n### 💼 Other\r\n\r\n- *(deps)* Bump rustls from 0.23.45 to 0.23.46 (#44)\r\n- Bump version to 0.2.2"
